oduct ends up expiring as paid-for waste, and capacity overflow is possible.\n- **Plan 2:** about 1.0 × forecast, which is below expected demand. That means steady shortages, which cost a lot on product 0.\n- **Plan 7:** 4-day cycles. Product 0 is under-ordered (about 0.875 × forecast for days 7–10), and full 128-unit deliveries on top of leftover stock overflow capacity.\n- **Plan 1:** about 1.1 × forecast with daily ordering. The fees eat roughly 500 more than the 2-day plans.\n\nAll plans except 1 run short on days 1–2, because nothing ordered can arrive before day 3; plan 1 runs short as well. This hits every plan about equally, so it doesn't change the ranking."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5056, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5056}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:55:43.806Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWAk97MywVBwccLKYeGJ"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_018azzyfW4RaVNWisa3QmV7y", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWAk9QxkEa8aBVD1bUbX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_018azzyfW4RaVNWisa3QmV7y", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.8, 0.12, 0.25, 0.6, 0.4, 0.75, 0.72, 0.3]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": nu